<<<
PURISM. Now & then a person may be heard to ' confess', in the pride that apes humility, to being 'a bit of a purist'; but purist & purism are for the most part missile words, which we all of us fling at anyone who insults us by finding not good enough for him some
===
**PURISM.** Now & then a person may be heard to ' confess ', in the pride that apes humility, to being ' a bit of a purist ' ; but *purist* & *purism* are for the most part missile words, which we all of us fling at anyone who insults us by finding not good enough for him some
>>>

